WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.147
– Rita, have you got a minute?
– Yes, go ahead.

2
00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:18.207
I've noticed you've been
leaving late, after hours,

3
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:19.525
and you seem quieter.

4
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:23.267
– Is everything ok?
– Yes, it's just a backlog of work.

5
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.645
Ok, if you need to talk, I'm here.

6
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.877
No need to tell me now
if you don't want to,

7
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.087
but I want you to know I'm here.

8
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.668
Honestly, I can't keep up with everything.

9
00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:43.030
I feel like I'm always behind and I get
anxious just looking at my email.

10
00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.387
Thank you for sharing that with me.

11
00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.207
It really seems like you're overloaded.

12
00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.437
The truth is,
with the amount of work we've had,

13
00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.523
it's natural to feel like this.

14
00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:56.862
These are common, natural symptoms
when there's significant overload.

15
00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.002
What's been hardest for you to deal with?

16
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.669
Is it the deadlines,
the work, or something else?

17
00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:07.887
It's everything together,
but… but mostly the deadlines.

18
00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:10.337
I feel like I can't switch off.

19
00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:12.707
Ok, let's simplify this together.

20
00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.849
What are the two or three things
you think are most urgent right now?

21
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:22.907
Well, this month's campaign, the weekly
report and this week's presentation.

22
00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:26.000
Ok, so you'll focus only on the campaign.

23
00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.022
I'll reassign the weekly report.

24
00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:33.849
And as for the presentation,
we'll adjust the deadline if needed, ok?

25
00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.062
Ok, thank you.

26
00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:38.687
And today you're not working late,

27
00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:41.771
because rest is important
and you need to rest, ok?

28
00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:43.447
Ok, thank you.

29
00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:47.927
If you feel this continues, we can look
at other ways to help you better.

30
00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:50.363
You don't have to go through this alone.

31
00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.987
And we'll keep an eye on this
over the next few days, ok?

32
00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:56.777
Deal. Thank you for talking to me.
